            {ANALYTICS.coverageGapAvgPpOverExpansion.toFixed(2)} pp; Marketplace offsets only ~
            {ANALYTICS.marketplaceOffsetOfLossPct}% of national net exits.
          </p>
        </ChartCard>
      )}

      <p className="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500">{SOURCE_NOTE}</p>
    </div>
